@building_the_right
title: Building the Right
subtitle: Push the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> to the right.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; nationalist_strength += 6; nationalist_dissent -= 8; liberal_dissent += 2; dvp_right += 2

We have increased the strength of the nationalist faction with the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span>.


@nsdap_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the far right
subtitle: Push the party to be more friendly towards the far right parties.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; nationalist_strength += 5; dnvp_relation += 5*(1-dissent) if dnvp_leader = "Hugenberg"; nsdap_relation += 3*(1-dissent); liberal_dissent += 5; dvp_right += 1

Hugo has reached out to the National Opposition, the <span style="color: #954B00;">**NSDAP**</span> [? if dnvp_leader = "Hugenberg": and the <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span>'s Hugenberg ?].


@nationalism_rally
title: Rally for nationalism
subtitle: Increase support for nationalism across Germany.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; nationalism += 4*(1-dissent); pro_republic -= 3*(1-dissent); liberal_dissent += 8

Nationalism has always been an omnipresent force in Germany, though it started losing steam with the stabilization of the Republic. We have given it new life.
